# ATTACK_NET Configuration

KALI01 was isolated on:

```text
10.10.20.0/24
```

Configuration:

```text
IP Address:      10.10.20.10
Subnet:          255.255.255.0
Default Gateway: 10.10.20.1
```

Routing was validated using:

```bash
ip addr
ip route
```

KALI01 therefore resides on a separate network from all corporate systems.

