# Troubleshooting Methodology Demonstrated

This sprint demonstrated a layered troubleshooting process:

```text
Connectivity Failure
        |
        v
Verify IP Addressing
        |
        v
Verify Routing
        |
        v
Verify Firewall Rule
        |
        v
Inspect pfctl Rule Counters
        |
        v
Capture Traffic with tcpdump
        |
        v
Determine Request/Reply Direction
        |
        v
Investigate Endpoint Firewall
        |
        v
Implement Scoped Rule
        |
        v
Retest
        |
        v
SUCCESS
```

This avoided making unnecessary configuration changes while progressively isolating the failure.

