The completed environment now contains:

- Dedicated corporate network
- Dedicated attack/testing network
- pfSense security boundary
- Controlled inter-network communication
- Endpoint firewall enforcement
- Active Directory services on CORP-LAN
- Centralized Splunk infrastructure on CORP-LAN
